<div class="spa-container">
  <section class="snap-section dark" id="timer-update">
    <h1>CuOS IaC Config</h1>
    <p>Please input signed configuration:</p>
    <p>Command: <code>tool.sh config-sign system.json</code></p>
    <p>It replaces the configuration the device got from outside, as the repository's system.json does: sign the complete system.json, a key left out is removed.</p>
    <form method="POST">
      <textarea name="config" style="width: 80vw; height: 400px; border: 2px solid gray; color: white; background-color: transparent;"></textarea>
      <br/>
      <button class="update-btn" type="submit">Submit</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>
